   "text": "SAE University College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nSAE University College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nA renowned Australian University College and global pioneer in creative media and technology, SAE provides specialist higher education courses worldwide to inspire and develop our graduates.\nLocated in Adelaide Brisbane, Byron Bay, Melbourne, Perth, and Sydney – our Australian student body consists of over 2,500 creatives who excel in programs across nine disciplines – Animation, Audio, Computer Science, Creative Industries, Design, Film, Games, Music, VFX & Virtual Production.\nWe’re passionate about our students’ potential and encourage them to chase their dreams. We promise that your SAE experience – wherever you are enrolled in the world – will offer a progressive learning experience to meet your creative, technological and professional aspirations, help you stand out from the crowd, and give you a ticket to the global stage.\nWelcome to our creative world!\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:19\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n19/01/2026 10:46\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nAustralia\nYearly Fees\nMax: A$27,960.00\nMin: A$24,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n38%\n150 of 400 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1976\nCampus(es)\nAdelaide, Brisbane, Melbourne, Perth, Sydney\nCountry\nAustralia\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@SAEInstituteAUS\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
